      "raw": "<p>I realize this is still a spirit in testing, but for any playtesters out there, I had a question re: the wording on the Incite the Mob card:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 Invader with [Strife] deals damage to other Invaders. &nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If it is then the only Invader left in target land, remove 1 [Strife] from it. &nbsp;<br />\r\n<strong>Otherwise, 1 [Fear].</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is a power in Slow power, taking place after the Invaders Ravage and Strife tokens are removed. &nbsp;What if all of the Strife tokens have been removed in a land -- does the \"Otherwise 1 [Fear]\" language still operate? &nbsp;Does it matter whether there is a single Invader or more than one Invader in the land?</p>",
